                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Springer to Mr.
                            Rockhill.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-12-23"><hi rendition="#italic">December 23,
                        1896</hi></date>.<lb/>(Received December 30, 1896.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Trial of Sanguily commenced Monday. Finished to-day. Sentence within three
                    days.</p>
